    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'Sullivan Hurley are delighted to welcome Droim Riasc, an exciting new development of high-quality 2, 3 and 4-bedroom semi-detached, terraced and detached homes in the heart of Tulla, Co. Clare.\n\nDesigned with modern family living in mind, Droim Riasc offers a selection of spacious, energy-efficient homes featuring generous rear gardens, private parking, landscaped open spaces and high-quality finishes throughout. Each home has been carefully designed to provide bright, well-proportioned living accommodation with practical layouts to suit a wide range of buyers.\n\nA choice of finishes is available, allowing purchasers the opportunity to personalise their new home by selecting their preferred flooring, kitchen and tiling finishes, creating a home tailored to their own individual style and taste.\n\nFirst-time buyers can also benefit from significant government supports. The development is registered for the Help to Buy Scheme, allowing eligible purchasers to avail of up to 30,000 towards the purchase price, subject to the scheme's terms and eligibility criteria. The First Home Scheme is also available to eligible purchasers, providing further support towards home ownership.\n\nStructural guarantees are included as standard with each property, providing additional peace of mind for purchasers with some of the many features include air to water heating systems with underfloor heating on the ground floors.\n\nIdeally located in the centre of Tulla, homeowners will enjoy being within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities, including primary and secondary schools, shops and essential services.\n\nTulla also offers an excellent choice of sporting and recreational facilities, including Tulla GAA, Tulla United Soccer Club and the local running track. The surrounding East Clare area is renowned for its beautiful countryside and abundance of lakes, with fishing and horse riding among the many popular outdoor pursuits available locally.\n\nFor commuters, the development is ideally positioned approximately 12 minutes' drive from Ennis and the M18 motorway, providing convenient access to Shannon, Limerick and Galway.\n\nDroim Riasc combines the convenience and community atmosphere of village living with excellent transport links, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families, commuters and those seeking a well-connected home in Co. Clare.\n\n\nEnquiries\n\nSole Selling Agents\nDNG O'Sullivan Hurley\nPSL002295\n\nEmail: cced@dngosullivanhurley.com \nWebsite: Droimriasc.ie"
      },
      {
